sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Students
    participant API as FastAPI Supervisor
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Queue
    participant Coach as Coach Worker
    participant Research as Research Worker
    participant Schedule as Scheduler Worker
    participant Originality as Originality Worker
    participant Citation as Citation Worker
    participant Reviewer as Reviewer Worker

    Students->>API: Submit workflows A, B and C
    API->>DB: Create 18 jobs atomically
    API-->>Students: 202 Accepted + final task IDs

    Coach->>DB: Claim A-Coach
    Coach->>DB: Persist A plan

    par Workflow A specialist branches
        Research->>DB: Claim A-Research
        Schedule->>DB: Claim A-Schedule
        Originality->>DB: Claim A-Originality
    and Next workflow begins
        Coach->>DB: Claim B-Coach
    end

    Research->>DB: Persist A research strategy
    Citation->>DB: Claim A-Citation
    Citation->>DB: Persist A citation checklist

    Schedule->>DB: Persist A schedule
    Originality->>DB: Persist A preflight

    Reviewer->>DB: Claim A-Review
    Reviewer->>DB: Load five upstream results
    Reviewer->>DB: Persist final A package

    Note over Coach,Reviewer: The same pipeline continues for workflows B and C
    Students->>API: Poll final task IDs
    API->>DB: Read persisted results
    API-->>Students: Completed workflow results
